is cousin Erzhu Shilong and nephew Erzhu Zhao subsequently captured and killed Xiaozhuang.","wp_description":"Emperor of Northern Wei","wikipedia_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emperor_Xiaozhuang_of_Northern_Wei","image_lead":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8e/%E9%AD%8F%E5%AD%9D%E8%8E%8A%E5%B8%9D%EF%BC%88%E5%8C%97%E5%8F%B2%E6%BC%94%E7%BE%A9%EF%BC%89.jpg","thumbnail":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/%E9%AD%8F%E5%AD%9D%E8%8E%8A%E5%B8%9D%EF%BC%88%E5%8C%97%E5%8F%B2%E6%BC%94%E7%BE%A9%EF%BC%89.jpg/960px-%E9%AD%8F%E5%AD%9D%E8%8E%8A%E5%B8%9D%EF%BC%88%E5%8C%97%E5%8F%B2%E6%BC%94%E7%BE%A9%EF%BC%89.jpg","chat_ready":true,"display_from":528,"display_to":531}